cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the paper below."
title: "Bonds or Gold: The Price of Monetary Trust"
abstract: >
  A test of the practitioner four-quadrant allocation framework, decomposed into
  its energy and monetary axes on thirteen markets. The monetary axis, a bond
  total-return index over gold, survives in the full sample; the energy axis does
  not; the surviving rule is a single binary switch between bonds and gold. The
  monetary advantage concentrates before the gold float and is not established in
  the modern tradeable sample.
type: software
